{"id":8376,"name":"Cuyahoga County","slug":"cuyahoga-county","state":"Ohio","code":"OH","program":null,"sourceUrl":"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/hybrid/hybrid-tax-sales-states/ohio-tax-deed-and-tax-liens/cuyahoga-county/","lastUpdated":"2025-05-06T02:29:14","facts":{"taxSaleType":"Tax Lien Certificates","typicalSaleDate":"Advertised in November, following July tax collection","redemptionPeriod":"12 months","interestRate":"Up to 18%","bidProcedure":"Bulk sales, not individual properties","deposit":"Payments must be made with guaranteed funds"},"bodyHtml":"\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed aligncenter is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"ACv7UBtLzhQ5wXkpJrMmNE0SFie8\"><iframe title=\"Are Tax Liens or Tax Deeds Your Best Bet? - Cuyahoga County- Ohio Tax Lien &amp; Deed Investing\" width=\"563\" height=\"1000\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/9yzMcePQZI8?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Get Dustin Hahn’s Tax Lien and Deed FREE Mini-Course</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Cuyahoga-County,-Ohio:-Are-Tax-Liens-or-Tax-Deeds-Your-Best-Bet?\">Cuyahoga County, Ohio: Are Tax Liens or Tax Deeds Your Best Bet?</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Discover Cuyahoga County, <a href=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/hybrid/hybrid-tax-sales-states/ohio-tax-deed-and-tax-liens/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Ohio</mark></a>, a goldmine for real estate investors with its massive Tax Lien and Deed Sales, offering a direct path to Cleveland&#8217;s thriving property market.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>As Ohio&#8217;s second-most populous county, with Cleveland as its core, Cuyahoga offers unique strategies for investors. Here&#8217;s a detailed look into the opportunities:</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Tax-Lien-Certificate-Sales\">Cuyahoga County Tax Lien Certificate Sales</h3>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Overview:</strong><br>In these sales, you purchase the delinquent taxes in bulk. Sales usually average between $10 million and $17 million and cover thousands of parcels. The investor gains a first-priority lien. If the lien remains unredeemed after a year, the investor can initiate foreclosure proceedings.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Important Details:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Tax-Deed-Sales\">Tax Deed Sales in Cuyahoga County</h3>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Overview:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p>Cuyahoga County holds online Tax Deed Sales every Tuesday at 9:00 am. Bidders must register, meet deposit requirements, and pay successful bids with a certified bank check or money order, plus additional fees.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Important Details:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><th>Detail</th><th>Information</th></tr><tr><td><strong>Tax Sale Type</strong></td><td>Tax Deed Sales</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Typical Sale Date</strong></td><td>Every Tuesday at 9:00 am</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Bid Procedure</strong></td><td>Online auctions, terms specified by Real Auction</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Deposit</strong></td><td>A certified bank check or money order is required</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Cleaveland-Cuyahoga-Couty-Ohio-USA.webp 1081w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Cleaveland-Cuyahoga-Couty-Ohio-USA-541x360.webp 541w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Cleaveland-Cuyahoga-Couty-Ohio-USA-296x197.webp 296w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Cleaveland-Cuyahoga-Couty-Ohio-USA-768x512.webp 768w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Cleaveland-Cuyahoga-Couty-Ohio-USA-20x13.webp 20w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Cleaveland-Cuyahoga-Couty-Ohio-USA-32x21.webp 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Cleaveland-Cuyahoga-Couty-Ohio-USA.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1081\" srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Cleaveland-Cuyahoga-Couty-Ohio-USA.png 1081w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Cleaveland-Cuyahoga-Couty-Ohio-USA-541x360.png 541w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Cleaveland-Cuyahoga-Couty-Ohio-USA-296x197.png 296w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Cleaveland-Cuyahoga-Couty-Ohio-USA-768x512.png 768w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Cleaveland-Cuyahoga-Couty-Ohio-USA-20x13.png 20w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Cleaveland-Cuyahoga-Couty-Ohio-USA-32x21.png 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" class=\"wp-image-16785 sp-no-webp\" alt=\"Cleaveland, Cuyahoga Couty Ohio, USA\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"  > </picture></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--1\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Book a Call with Dustin Hahn</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-links-for-more-information\">Links for More Information:</h3>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>County Tax Lien Information Links:</strong><br><a href=\"https://cuyahogacounty.gov/treasury/pay-your-taxes/tax-lien-certificate-sales\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Tax Lien Certificate Sales</mark></a></p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>County Tax Deed Information Links:</strong><br><a href=\"https://cuyahogacms.blob.core.windows.net/home/docs/default-source/sheriff/terms-of-sales.pdf?sfvrsn=763f2449_1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Terms of Sales</mark></a></p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>County Treasurer’s Office:</strong><br><a href=\"https://cuyahogacounty.gov/treasury\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Treasurer&#8217;s Office</mark></a></p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>County Sheriff’s Office:</strong><br><a href=\"https://www.cuyahogacounty.gov/sheriff\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Sheriff’s Office</mark></a></p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Cuyahoga County:</strong><br><a href=\"https://cuyahogacounty.gov/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Official Website</mark></a></p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Cuyahoga County Foreclosure Auction Site:</strong><br><a href=\"https://cuyahoga.sheriffsaleauction.ohio.gov/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Foreclosure Auction Site</mark></a></p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Interesting-Facts-about-Real-Estate-in-Cuyahoga-County\">Interesting Facts about Real Estate in Cuyahoga County</h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Cuyahoga County is a large urban county in northeastern Ohio, with Cleveland as its county seat. As of the 2020 census, its population was 1,264,817, making it the second-most populous county in the state. The Cuyahoga County name comes from the Cuyahoga River, which means &#8220;crooked river&#8221; in the Iroquoian language.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Pro Tips for Investors:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Research Thoroughly:</strong> Understand local laws and the specific details of each sale.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Check Redemption Periods:</strong> Be aware of the timeframes for property redemption.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Legal Advice:</strong> Consider consulting a lawyer to navigate foreclosure processes.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Frequently-Asked-Questions-(FAQs)\">Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)</h3>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q1: What happens if my tax lien is sold?</strong> </p>\n\n\n\n<p>The county places a tax lien certificate on the property. If the owner does not redeem it within twelve months, the purchaser initiates foreclosure.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q2: How can I avoid a tax foreclosure?</strong> </p>\n\n\n\n<p>You can pay your taxes in full or set up a payment plan with the Cuyahoga County Treasury.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q3: What payment methods are accepted for tax deed purchases?</strong> </p>\n\n\n\n<p>Payments must be made via certified bank check or money order.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-need-a-hand\">Need a Hand? </h3>\n\n\n\n<p>If you need further assistance or guidance with tax lien investing, don&#8217;t hesitate to reach out. To book a call and access free resources, visit the Cuyahoga County <a href=\"https://cuyahogacounty.gov/treasury\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Treasurer’s Office</mark></a> or <a href=\"https://www.cuyahogacounty.gov/sheriff\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Sheriff’s Office</mark></a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p></p>\n<p><em>Sign up or log in to view the full content.</em></p><div id=\"popup-overlay\"></div><div id=\"signup-popup\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 20px;\"><h4>Get Instant Free Access To The Training Vault Now</h4><p>Learn how to get 18-36% returns on your investment and buy property for as little as $500 with tax lien and tax deeds.</p><div class=\"video-container\" style=\"display: flex; justify-content: center; margin: 20px 0;\"><iframe src=\"https://youtube.com/embed/FkB-M8RaSHo\" allowfullscreen style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 560px; height: 315px; border: none; border-radius: 8px;\"></iframe></div><div class=\"button-container\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 10px;\"><button style=\"padding: 10px 20px; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Sign Up for FREE Access</button><button style=\"padding: 10px 20px; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Already a Member? Login</button></div></div>","upcomingCount":0}